# Packages excluded from the measured coverage denominator.
#
# These carry no meaningful test signal for the floor: generated code, the
# test-only architecture package, the fake AzerothCore double and command
# wiring. They are still reported, but never counted in the total.
#
# Globs: `*` and `?` do not cross a `/`, `**` does.
internal/plugins/*/repository/generated
internal/architecture
internal/fake/azerothcore
cmd/
